---
layout: base.njk
title: "Tentang eDagang — Platform Latihan B2B & eCommerce Malaysia"
description: "eDagang adalah platform latihan B2B dan eCommerce yang dibina oleh Borong, marketplace B2B terbesar Malaysia. Kenali misi, visi dan pasukan di sebalik eDagang."
canonical: "/about"
pageStyles: |
  .origin-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:64px; align-items:start; }
  .origin-visual {
    background:var(--purple); border-radius:var(--radius-lg); padding:40px;
    color:var(--white); position:relative; overflow:hidden;
  }
  .origin-visual::before {
    content:''; position:absolute; top:-60px; right:-60px;
    width:200px; height:200px;
    background:rgba(255,255,255,0.05); border-radius:50%;
  }
  .origin-visual::after {
    content:''; position:absolute; bottom:-40px; left:-40px;
    width:140px; height:140px;
    background:rgba(232,149,0,0.15); border-radius:50%;
  }
  .origin-stat { margin-bottom:24px; }
  .origin-stat .num { font-size:36px; font-weight:800; color:var(--orange); letter-spacing:-1px; line-height:1; }
  .origin-stat .lbl { font-size:13px; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55); margin-top:4px; }
  .origin-stat-divider { height:1px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.12); margin:20px 0; }
  .value-card { border-left:3px solid var(--purple); padding:20px 24px; background:var(--gray-50); border-radius:0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0; }
  .value-icon { font-size:24px; margin-bottom:10px; }
  .value-title { font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:8px; }
  .value-desc { font-size:14px; color:var(--gray-600); line-height:1.7; }
  .timeline { position:relative; padding-left:32px; }
  .timeline::before { content:''; position:absolute; left:10px; top:8px; bottom:8px; width:2px; background:var(--gray-200); }
  .tl-item { position:relative; margin-bottom:28px; }
  .tl-dot { position:absolute; left:-27px; top:4px; width:12px; height:12px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--purple); border:2px solid var(--white); box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--purple); }
  .tl-year { font-size:11px; font-weight:700; color:var(--orange); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.07em; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .tl-title { font-size:15px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px; }
  .tl-desc { font-size:13px; color:var(--gray-600); line-height:1.65; }
  @media(max-width:720px){ .origin-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:36px; } }
---

<div class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="label-tag">Tentang Kami</span>
    <h1 class="page-hero-title">Kenapa eDagang <span style="font-family:'Instrument Serif',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:var(--purple)">Wujud</span></h1>
